{"productId": "4736fc0c-d972-49e7-894c-910565986baf", "modelName": "Tope", "modelDescription": "The Fusion Tope model brings you back to the \u201cgood-ol\u2019-day\u2019s\u201d of a classic pump-shotgun design proud to own. With its rugged construction and traditional walnut stock, the Tope makes for the perfect shotgun for an enjoyable day in the field. The Tope base model comes set-up with a 18.5\u201d choke tube ready barrel with fully adjustable rifle sights. This shotgun is set-up for deer, bear or boar hunts. There are also additional barrel assemblies available from 22.0\u201d to 28.0\u201d with bead sights so that you can easily convert the Tope for a fun day on the clays range or a upland game hunt. The receiver is also dovetailed so that you can add accessories such as rails, red-dot sights, \u2026etc. The Tope makes for a super \u201call-purpose\u201d universal shotgun which does not limit you when you want to make changes. From its checkered walnut stock to its HD-chrome lined chamber, fully adjustable sights & sling mounts, this shotgun is not just a stunning design, but also equipped for generations of use.", "manufacturerName": "Fusion Firearms", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "f1a445e6-b256-4b73-bba8-50479e8f7396", "description": "Fusion Firearms, Tope, Pump Shotgun, 12 Gauge, 3\" Chamber, 18.5\" Barrel, Black Finish, Walnut Stock, Fiber Optic Sights, 4+1 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/1d814a0e-f108-49fe-a7b0-7a0587845b61", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/e26df23c-cb82-4a7b-b943-dc745195c878", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/3b744d94-2582-4fb7-8a72-1a4c10c628c7", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/f6c897d6-60cd-472e-9089-9dba79199e12"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "LS-TP-12-18", "upc": "630835756263", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "70553990-2085-41b3-bf9c-a4a0bf7205a1", "attributeName": "